1
00:00:00,725 --> 00:00:02,638
You think you chose

2
00:00:02,688 --> 00:00:04,511
to watch this.

3
00:00:05,275 --> 00:00:07,328
But something made you

4
00:00:07,378 --> 00:00:09,008
stop scrolling.

5
00:00:09,058 --> 00:00:10,885
Something made you

6
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:11,919
curious.

7
00:00:12,321 --> 00:00:13,376
A notification.

8
00:00:13,426 --> 00:00:15,004
A tired day.

9
00:00:15,054 --> 00:00:16,884
A song you heard

10
00:00:16,934 --> 00:00:18,267
this morning.

11
00:00:18,862 --> 00:00:20,927
Every thought you have…

12
00:00:20,977 --> 00:00:22,343
was shaped by things

13
00:00:22,393 --> 00:00:23,476
you never chose.

14
00:00:23,526 --> 00:00:24,994
Your parents.

15
00:00:25,044 --> 00:00:26,374
Your language.

16
00:00:26,424 --> 00:00:29,057
The year you were born.

17
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:30,507
Even the way

18
00:00:30,557 --> 00:00:32,434
you'll answer this…

19
00:00:32,484 --> 00:00:33,589
was written long

20
00:00:33,639 --> 00:00:35,028
before tonight.

21
00:00:35,692 --> 00:00:36,407
And yet…

22
00:00:36,457 --> 00:00:37,910
right now…

23
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:40,281
it feels like you're

24
00:00:40,331 --> 00:00:42,141
the one deciding.

25
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,871
So if every choice

26
00:00:45,921 --> 00:00:46,992
has a cause…

27
00:00:47,042 --> 00:00:49,072
were any of them

28
00:00:49,122 --> 00:00:50,844
really yours?

